WEBVTT

51:02.294 --> 51:04.212
I suppose it makes sense.

51:04.338 --> 51:07.341
Your older brother was trained to lead
and you were trained to follow.

51:07.466 --> 51:10.552
I was also trained to kill
my enemies, Your Grace.

51:14.306 --> 51:16.308
As was I.

51:20.729 --> 51:24.691
(DOOR OPENS, CLOSES)

51:27.611 --> 51:29.613
(HORSE SNORTS)
